  "releaseNotes": "0.8.1\n- Improve performance, compatibility, and release reliability\n\n\n0.8.0\n- Add managed/native package version validation at detector startup\n- Preserve in-memory model data for label loading and detector setup\n- Make prediction and disposal paths safer when operations overlap\n- Improve native failure handling during detector creation and prediction\n- Add NuGet package icon and expanded package tags\n\n\n0.7.1\n- ARM64 support for Linux\n      \n0.6.1\n- Windows: static linking of Visual C++ Runtime\n      \n0.4.0.0\n- Add GetLabels method\n      \n0.0.0.21:\n- Default MediaPipe model is included in NuGet package\n\n0.0.0.10:\n- Initial release",
